{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_048EE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"听说在<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>启动之前，你亲眼看到Paz想破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\", \"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"呃……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是我……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"本该由我阻止她的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"如果那时候我没有逃走……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"在她登上去之前，我明明可以制止她……。要是我没让她登上<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，而是由我阻止她，她就不会死了……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":148,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"Paz当时有枪。大概也受过专业训练。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"别责怪自己。你当时手无寸铁，不可能阻止她。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"可是，哪怕只是跟她说说话……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"如果我答应她绝不告诉任何人，Paz就不会做出那种事了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"可我因为知道Paz是特工太受打击，就那么逃走了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Chico……。你看到她的时候，Paz确实正打算破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，对吧？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"诶？嗯。是啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"然后，她紧接着启动<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，想逼我服从她。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"有些不对劲。她为什么要破坏自己原本打算使用的<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"诶……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"即使她是特工，行动也前后矛盾。要是想破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，破坏后逃走就行了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"反过来，如果目的是夺走并利用<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>，那就没有想破坏<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>的理由。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\", \"<R=ZEKE,ZEKE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"这个……我也不知道……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"因为被你看见后改变了方针吗？还是说不通……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""}]}